  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "たいようの　ひかりを　あびるほどたいないで　からみせいぶんが　ふえてわざが　どんどん　からくなるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "태양 빛을 쬐면 쬘수록 체내의 매운 성분이 늘어나서 기술이 점점 더 매워진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "沐浴在太陽下越久，體內的辣味成分就會增加得越多，招式也會變得越來越辣。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Plus ce Pokémon s’expose au soleil, plus son corps produit une substance piquante, ce qui apporte un peu de piment à ses capacités.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Je länger es Sonnenlicht tankt, desto intensiver werden die Scharfstoffe in seinem Körper und umso pikanter fallen seine Attacken aus.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuanto más se expone al sol, más aumenta la cantidad de capsaicinoides de su cuerpo y, por lo tanto, la pungencia de sus movimientos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Più si espone alla luce solare e più all’interno del suo corpo aumentano le sostanze che determinano la piccantezza delle sue mosse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The more sunlight this Pokémon bathes in, the more spicy chemicals are produced by its body, and thus the spicier its moves become.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "太陽の　光を　浴びるほど体内で　辛み成分が　増えて技が　どんどん　辛くなるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "沐浴在太阳下越久，体内的辣味成分就会变得越多，招式也会变得越来越辣。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuanto más se expone al sol, más aumenta la cantidad de capsaicinoides de su cuerpo y, por lo tanto, la pungencia de sus movimientos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "パルデアの　きょうどりょうりはぬけおちた　カプサイジの　まえばがつかわれているので　げきからなのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "팔데아의 향토 요리에는 떨어져 나온 캡싸이의 앞니가 쓰이기 때문에 불같이 맵다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "帕底亞當地會用熱辣娃掉落的門牙來做料理，所以超級無敵霹靂辣。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Une fois tombée, l’incisive de ce Pokémon sert à relever les plats de la région de Paldea.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die regionale Küche Paldeas ist sehr scharf, weil die ausgefallenen Vorderzähne von Chilingel zum Würzen verwendet werden.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En Paldea es común emplear los incisivos caídos de los Capsakid como ingrediente, lo que aporta un toque muy picante a los platos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La cucina di Paldea fa ampio uso degli incisivi caduti dei Capsakid, che rendono i piatti estremamente piccanti.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Traditional Paldean dishes can be extremely spicy because they include the shed front teeth of Capsakid among their ingredients.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "パルデアの　郷土料理は抜け落ちた　カプサイジの　前歯が使われているので　激辛なのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "帕底亚的当地特色菜会用热辣娃掉落的门牙来做料理，因此味道极其辛辣。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En Paldea es común emplear los incisivos caídos de los Capsakid como ingrediente, lo que aporta un toque muy picante a los platos.",
      "language": {
